<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: grenade round -->
  <Bullet_DMS_GrenadeLauncher.label>榴弹</Bullet_DMS_GrenadeLauncher.label>
  
  <!-- EN: full-power rifle bullet -->
  <Bullet_DMS_LightMachineGun.label>全威力步枪弹</Bullet_DMS_LightMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: .338 magnum bullet -->
  <DMS_Bullet_338Magnum.label>马格南步枪弹</DMS_Bullet_338Magnum.label>
  
  <!-- EN: A .338 magnum rifle cartridge. It carries far more energy downrange than a full-power battle rifle round while remaining light enough to be fired from a semi-automatic action without a mech-grade recoil buffer. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_338Magnum.description>马格南步枪弹在远距离上保有的能量远高于全威力步枪弹，同时又轻到能在没有机兵级后座缓冲的半自动枪机上使用。</DMS_Bullet_338Magnum.description>
  
  <!-- EN: 12 gauge slug -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Slug.label>独头弹</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Slug.label>
  
  <!-- EN: A single rifled lead slug instead of a spread of pellets. It reaches much further and punches through light plating, but only one projectile leaves the barrel per trigger pull. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Slug.description>以单颗带膛线的铅弹头取代散开的弹丸。射程远得多，也能打穿轻装甲板，但每次扣下扳机只有一发弹头离膛。</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Slug.description>
  <!-- EN: 12 gauge dragon's breath -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Dragon.label>12号口径龙息弹</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Dragon.label>
  <!-- EN: A shell packed with zirconium pellets that ignite the moment they clear the muzzle. The burning cloud spends itself within a few paces, which is exactly the distance the loader cares about. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Dragon.description>装填锆合金颗粒的弹壳，颗粒一离开枪口就会自燃。这团火焰只能推进几步就耗尽，而那正好是装填手唯一在意的距离。</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Dragon.description>

  <!-- EN: 12 gauge tungsten flechette -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Flechette.label>12号口径钨芯飞镖弹</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Flechette.label>
  <!-- EN: A sabot shell holding a bundle of tungsten-cored darts. Each dart carries almost no mass and does little to soft tissue, but the cores hold together against plating that stops a lead pellet cold. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Flechette.description>内装一束钨芯飞镖的脱壳弹托弹。每支飞镖质量极小，对软组织作用有限，但钨芯能在铅弹丸完全打不动的装甲板上撑住不碎。</DMS_Bullet_AssaultShotgun_Flechette.description>
  
  
  <!-- EN: Mech AMR -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.label>反器材步枪</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: A high caliber sniper rifle made to be used by MS-4E Jadger automatroids to destroy armored target at long ranges.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.description>一种发射大口径机枪弹的重型狙击步枪，用於在对抗重型装甲单位的战斗中远距离狙击目标</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech AMR -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>反器材步枪</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵反器材步枪</DMS_AntiMaterialRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech Assault Rifle -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.label>机兵突击步枪</DMS_AssaultRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: An easily mass produced assault rifle designed for mech soldiers equipped with an extra long picatinny rail for all tacticool needs.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.description>一种专为机兵设计的全金属突击步枪，有一个与枪本身一样长的皮卡汀尼导轨，可满足所有战术需要。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。</DMS_AssaultRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech Assault Rifle -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>机兵突击步枪</DMS_AssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_AssaultRifle.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_AssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵突击步枪</DMS_AssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech Assault Shotgun -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.label>机兵突击霰弹枪</DMS_AssaultShotgun.label>
  <!-- EN: A fully automatic shotgun able to be mass produced with stamped components.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.description>使用冲压部件快速制造的自动霰弹枪。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。</DMS_AssaultShotgun.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech Assault Shotgun -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>机兵突击霰弹枪</DMS_AssaultShotgun.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>
  <!-- 弹种切换 / ammo switch -->
  <!-- EN: buckshot -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>鹿弹</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The standard three round burst of pellets. Nothing clever about it, and nothing unarmored enjoys standing in front of it. -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>标准的三连发散开弹丸。没有任何巧思，但没有装甲的东西都不会想站在它前面。</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: slug -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>独头弹</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: A single rifled slug in place of the pellet spread. It reaches far further and punches through light plating, at the cost of one projectile per trigger pull. -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>以单颗带膛线的弹头取代散开的弹丸。射程远得多，也能打穿轻装甲板，代价是每次扣下扳机只有一发弹头离膛。</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  <!-- EN: tungsten flechette -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>钨芯飞镖弹</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>
  <!-- EN: A sabot load of tungsten-cored darts. Each one carries almost no mass, so flesh barely notices them, but five of them per pull will find their way through plating that shrugs off buckshot outright. -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>以脱壳弹托发射的一束钨芯飞镖。每一支的质量都极小，血肉之躯几乎不当一回事，但一次五发能穿过完全挡得住鹿弹的装甲板。</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>
  <!-- EN: dragon's breath -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.3.label>龙息弹</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.3.label>
  <!-- EN: Zirconium pellets that ignite as they leave the barrel. The burning cloud carries only a few paces and does little damage by itself, but four shells of it will set a corridor alight and keep anything from walking down it. -->
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.3.description>一离开枪口就自燃的锆合金颗粒。火焰只能推进几步，本身伤害也有限，但四发打下去足以点燃整条走廊，让任何东西都走不过来。</DMS_AssaultShotgun.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.3.description>
  
