  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_AssaultShotgun.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_AssaultShotgun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵突击霰弹枪</DMS_AssaultShotgun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech Grenade Launcher -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>机兵榴弹发射器</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A handheld automatic grenade launcher for clearing out clustered targets.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations.\n\nIts tripod folds under the receiver, so a drafted operator can set it down into a firing position on the spot and break it back down just as quickly. -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>手持式自动榴弹发射器，用於清除集群目标。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。\n\n三脚架收折在机匣下方，征召中的操作者可以就地把它架设成射击阵地，也能同样迅速地拆收带走。</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech Grenade Launcher -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>机兵榴弹发射器</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵榴弹发射器</DMS_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech Battle Rifle -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.label>机兵战斗步枪</DMS_BattleRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: A battle rifle built for mech soldiers intended for mech to mech combat.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.description>一种用於机兵的全金属战斗步枪，在相对於重机枪而言具有更轻的质量与优秀的射击速度，被用於危险的机兵对机兵战斗中。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。</DMS_BattleRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_BattleRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_BattleRifle.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech Battle Rifle -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>机兵战斗步枪</DMS_BattleRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_BattleRifle.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_BattleRifle.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_BattleRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵战斗步枪</DMS_BattleRifle.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech LMG -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.label>机兵轻机枪</DMS_LightMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A weapon specializing in supression chambered in a large caliber rifle round.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations.\n\nIts folding bipod lets a drafted operator drop it into a firing position on the spot, and pick it back up just as quickly. -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.description>使用全威力步枪弹的压制性武器。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。\n\n附有可折叠的两脚架，征召中的操作者可以就地把它架设成射击阵地，也能同样迅速地收起带走。</DMS_LightMachineGun.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.barrel.label>枪管</DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Mech LMG -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>机兵轻机枪</DMS_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</DMS_LightMachineGun.tools.muzzle.label>
  <DMS_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机兵轻机枪</DMS_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mech Marksman Rifle -->
  <DMS_MarksmanRifle.label>射手步枪</DMS_MarksmanRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic rifle with a free floating barrel to improve accuracy over a distance. Comes equipped from the factory with a three-round-burst option.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_MarksmanRifle.description>一种具有高射击精度和快速射击能力的半自动狙击步枪，其优秀的稳定性与制退设计使其对於人类而言也并非无法驾驭。</DMS_MarksmanRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <DMS_MarksmanRifle.tools.stock.label>枪托</DMS_MarksmanRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
