  <!-- EN: Mech Semiauto Rifle -->
  <DMS_SemiAutoRifle.label>机兵半自动步枪</DMS_SemiAutoRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: A gas blowback semi-automatic rifle used by mech soldiers. \n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_SemiAutoRifle.description>由机兵使用的导气式半自动步枪，性能可靠，但对人类而言可能太过沉重。\n\n这种武器是专门为机兵设计的，因此如果没有外部辅助设备或超强的力量，普通人可能无法正常使用。</DMS_SemiAutoRifle.description>
