  <!-- EN: Sniper Grenade Launcher -->
  <DMS_SniperGrenadeLauncher.label>狙击榴弹发射器</DMS_SniperGrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A precision grenade launcher designed to serve as a counter-sniper.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations. -->
  <DMS_SniperGrenadeLauncher.description>专为反狙击而设计的精确榴弹发射器。\n\n该武器是专为机兵使用而设计的，因此普通人在没有外部辅助设备或超强力量的情况下可能无法正常使用它们。</DMS_SniperGrenadeLauncher.description>
